<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final day of</p>
<p>the</p>
<p>second test between Sri Lanka and India on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 332 (A. de Silva 146)</p>
<p>India first innings 375 (S.Ganguly 147, S.Tendulkar 139)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka second innings 415-7 declared (S.Jayasuriya 199,</p>
<p>A. de Silva 120)</p>
<p>India second innings (overnight 49-0)</p>
<p> A.Jadeja c Atapattu b S.de Silva	     73</p>
<p> N.Sidhu c Jayasuriya b Vaas		     16</p>
<p> R.Dravid c Atapattu b Muralitharan	    6</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar c S.de Silva b Muralitharan     8</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin not out			    108</p>
<p> S.Ganguly c Kaluwitharana b Muralitharan   45</p>
<p> N.Mongia not out				   10</p>
<p> Extras (b-1 lb-7 nb-7)			   15</p>
<p> Total (for five wickets)			281</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-55 2-75 3-100 4-138 5-248</p>
<p>Bowling: Vaas 17-2-42-1 (1nb), S.de Silva 16-4-32-1,</p>
<p>Muralitharan 35-5-96-3 (6nb), Pushpakumara 14-1-50-0, Jayasuriya</p>
<p>10-4-24-0, Jayawardena 8-1-29-0</p>
<p>Result: Match drawn</p>
